Attention Layer:

query asks
key matches
value answers

query: the cat sat because it was tired
    if each word was a token, then each word also has its own position
to match: how relevant is this prior token to this current token?
    for each position the query asks if each word is relevant to another word in the sentence
value: the output is a probability of how good the match is
    it eventually realizes that 'it' and 'cat' are relevant to each other, with every other results yielding a much lower probability

How the matrices work:

A) Matrix Multiplication Examples
    A shape: [rows, shared]
    B shape: [shared, columns]
    A @ B shape: [rows, columns]

    let's do x @ y
    x = [[1, 2],
         [3, 4]]
    y = [[5, 6],
         [7, 8]]

    First result cell:
    top-left = row 1 of x · column 1 of y
             = [1, 2] · [5, 7]
             = 1*5 + 2*7
             = 19

    Top-right:
    top-right = row 1 of x · column 2 of y
              = [1, 2] · [6, 8]
              = 1*6 + 2*8
              = 22

    Bottom-left:
    bottom-left = row 2 of x · column 1 of y
                = [3, 4] · [5, 7]
                = 3*5 + 4*7
                = 43

    Bottom-right:
    bottom-right = row 2 of x · column 2 of y
                 = [3, 4] · [6, 8]
                 = 3*6 + 4*8
                 = 50

    So:
    x @ y =
    [[19, 22],
     [43, 50]]


B) Context of the Attention Layers

    query and key vectors are the same size
    value vectors tend to be but they don't need to be

    X = input token vectors

    Q = X @ Wq
    K = X @ Wk
    V = X @ Wv

    Q @ K.T = relevance_scores
        gives a square matrix
        (decide the routing)

    attention_weights = softmax(relevance_scores)
        softmax raises everything to e^, gets positive values and makes them probabilities, basically

    mixed_value_information = attention_weights @ V
        (send the message of probabilities through route)

    context_represented_as_a_vector = mixed_value_information @ Wo
        Wo being output weights
        this is uniquely shaped to translate this message from Qv to the perceptron's shape
        (rewrite the received message into the model's main vector language)
